---
description: Core rules for the Just Tell Me mobile assistant project
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `CURSOR_CONTEXT.md`, `ADR.md`, and `REQUIREMENTS.md` before substantial implementation work.

Never let LLM-generated text directly invoke arbitrary functions. Validate a versioned ActionPlan and map known action enums to registered handlers.

Every external side effect must pass the confirmation policy engine.

Never report an external action as completed unless the OS/API confirms it. WhatsApp/Telegram handoffs are `handed_off` unless an official API reports a send result.

Do not implement core product functionality using simulated taps, screen scraping, accessibility-service automation, or private APIs.

Keep secrets and OAuth credentials out of source control. Use secure storage and environment variables.

Add tests with each feature. Do not continue to the next PLAN.md milestone if the current milestone does not build and pass its tests.
